  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Enjoy the independence of a standalone home with the comfort of brand-new living at 64B County Road, Torbay.\r\nOffering three bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms and an internal-access single garage, this thoughtfully designed home combines modern style with everyday practicality. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area brings everyone together, while your own balcony offers a welcome spot to step outside and unwind.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n* Brand-new standalone home\r\n* Three bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n* Modern open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n* Balcony for outdoor relaxation\r\n* Internal-access single garage\r\n* Zoned for Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n\r\nWith local beaches, parks and Torbay shops within easy reach, this is an inviting option for buyers seeking a new home in an established North Shore neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nOne of five individually designed homes, with three and four-bedroom options available.\r\n\r\nContact us NOW to arrange a viewing and find your favourite.",
